Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,On this long journey that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only barely begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship, love, courage,\Nand a little bit of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That even as the years go by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Will not ever vanish from our minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are all pieces of\Na single planet Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Little by little we can\Nfind each other's worth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we see what sort of\Nform we're meant to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us know the wind will\Nalways keep on blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look through that wind to dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears as you're waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The things you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed will help\Nyou to become so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All the tears you shed\Nwill help you to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, everything, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now and forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the wind, feel it surround you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As you finish what you've begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the wind to dry all the tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're waving the\Nthings you must overcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the quest, join the adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Found in meeting somebody new!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never stop for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see that you're\Nup ahead waiting there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is like stupid hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so steamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Young, gorgeous, just my type. Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's hot enough to light hell on fire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Priorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the pansy prisoner\Nwho beat up all the guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who I am doesn't really\Nmatter right now, lover boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get some assistance here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see how sweaty I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, surely you can help\Nme out of these rags.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do it in here, right? Yep. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it's dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the worst day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just blame it on\Nthe warden, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that a\Nprisoner outsmarted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When do I get to be the warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I use too much poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my tummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the riot shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the prisoners have been returned to\Ntheir cells and we've retrieved the keys,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think some are missing.\NDamn it. What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be somewhere on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him and I'm going to whip the\Nsass right out of him! Yes, mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you decided to join us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You were sleeping forever. Want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace them for the newcomer,\Neveryone! Cheers! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been watching you\Nguys on our monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo. Quite the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll seat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where floor did you come from, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty to eat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd guess you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you somehow magically\Nmade it out of the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still an impel down, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's wearing any prison clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's drinking and having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I wake up in some kind of paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? Hold on. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was chased down and\Nattacked by those wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Strawboy woke up and helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then maybe I am dreaming or wait, what if
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I died from the cold\Nand I'm in heaven now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Close but no cigar you've\Nbeen sleeping like a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,baby out cold for 10 hours\Nnow 10 hours are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidding me and who are you? My\Nname is Inazuma. Mind your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,manners I'm the one who fetched\Nyou from that A bitter cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you two\Ndidn't die from exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you say you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you brought Strawboy here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up! Answer me! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him explain things to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Him? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the lights are down! It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The show's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll want a Frontier seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep tight, little candy boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say, little bong boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dixie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To get here, you have to pass\Nthrough the sewers of Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Following paths that shouldn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To a place beyond imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a prisoner's paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got every pleasure\Nyou could ever beg for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Games.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We have freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We got our freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the jailers are\Nflipping their tops again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Prisoners have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been pulled down into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those silly little fools\Ncouldn't be more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here and we're queer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't exactly call\Nthis hell, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who knows maybe it is,\Nbut if so, at least it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a gay one the secret\Nunderground where dreams come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,true i bid you welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to impel down level 5.5
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,bitches a secret garden for\Nall. All your prisoners, ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,this is Newcomer-land!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all queer like me. Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I got a little too\Nexcited dancing and cutting loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to collapse now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, maybe I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Eva the miracle worker, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've heard about\Nlittle Ongwa, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect when\Nyou're talking to Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's royalty, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to bow down before\Nthe Queen of New Karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail King Eva!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail King Eva!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail King Eva!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush now, my little candies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the admiration,\Nbut don't sweat the small stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about\Nsilly things like labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,People can call me whatever they like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They can even call me Dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,NEVER CALL ME Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really Eva, the Miracle Worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The same one that I've worshipped\Nfrom afar for oh so many years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Empire. Ivanka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the queen of\NKamabaka Kingdom, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,About 15 years ago, my father,\Nwho was the king of my homeland,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,visited that country of\Nyours, and then he...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He came back to us as a queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how ashamed I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His family and his country were ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell for my princely status\Nand nothing but a lonely pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But all the days I spent suffering\Nin this living hell are worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get one shot at the\Nmonster who destroyed my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you even get that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't point that at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you shoot me with that, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a character!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Deathwing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how we go. An eye, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some death wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With just a wink, he was able\Nto turn back that bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Empirical female hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what did you chew to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're throwing a fit because your\Nfather wanted to become a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Two mothers and one son, two\Nfathers and one daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You could become a woman or become a\Nman, hee-haw, or maybe you could be both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to\Ndecide for yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That what you call gender is a\Nlabel, it's nothing but a border.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no need for it, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is beyond it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all crossed over that silly border.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means you're looking\Nat the new human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Newcomer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the garden of freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Newcomer land!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We have rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned that guy into a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He truly is a miracle worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I bid you welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like to\Njoin in on the fun now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing's embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a long way to go before\Nbecoming a proper citizen of new karma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you, Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I never stopped believing\Nyou were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would hear it, I\Nhave a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear friend was poisoned by Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please save his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No antidote can help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying there, dying, and\Nthere's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you're talking\Nabout Straw Hat Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ever stop to wonder why we\Ntreated your injuries in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To be quite honest, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all just prisoners down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have the means\Nto simply take in and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,care for anyone that we\Nhappen to find injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not nearly so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I took you in and treated you\Nbecause your friend begged me to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trying to help me and\Ngot bitten by those wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something\Njust anyone would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when they're on the verge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know the flower of friendship\Ncould bloom in a hellhole like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do know that if I didn't help him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be no better than\Na demon in human guise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I already started treatment on\Nyour buddy Strawboy about ten hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's gonna be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds awful what's\Ngoing on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this healing\Nhe's been screaming like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,this the entire duration\Nof his treatment but i
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Assure you that's part of\Nthe process we've locked
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,him away for safety this\Nwill last another two
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it's going to cost you\Nif I administer this treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a high price, but that\Npoison is serious, Straw Hat boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.68,0:17:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me just so we're clear this\Nis a high-risk treatment there's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,no guarantee that it'll save your\Nlife in your current condition you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,have absolutely no chance of survival\Nthe best i could do for you through
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,this process is increase that chance\Nto two or three percent what you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,face right now is a battle the likes\Nof which you have never fought before
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you must temper that will of yours\Nto emerge victorious if the poison
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,wins you will most assuredly die but\Nif your spirit wins you walk away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it's as simple as that all right\Nthen I wish you a pleasant journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To the valley of death, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Empirical healing hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you pulling my tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat has been wailing in\Nagony like that for 10 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit and hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the vital\Nforces of the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Combined, the two bring forth\Na tremendous healing potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have drawn out his latent\Nimmunity and changed his
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,body to enable him to battle\Nwith the deadly poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Only time will tell which of\Nthe two of them is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Within that battlefield\Nof a body lies destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and recovery raging away\Nat extraordinary speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He will survive only if he\Ncan withstand all that pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And escaping from death\Ndoes not come cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can take a look inside\Nif you really want to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna tear him apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His body will be destroyed\Nfrom the inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.12,0:19:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't even him in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a living corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him suffer like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock those chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the bleeding and find\Na real way to cure him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the miracle worker, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's a mess, but\Nanything is better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm helping him the only way I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate\Nthe human will to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.91,0:20:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what it takes to\Nstrive against one's own mortality?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To face the ultimate odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a god or an angel\Nor anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me whatever the hell you\Nwant, but the truth of the matter is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never save a fool who doesn't\Nhave the will to save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved an impoverished\Ncountry and a country
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that was left in ruin after defeat in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But in both cases all I did was\Ndraw out their own spirit to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That can only happen to people who\Nhave the courage to keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Making miracles is never easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the hornhorn fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It gave me the fabulous power to\Nalter the hormones of anyone I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can change their sex, body temperature,\Nskin color, growth, even their emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can remodel people from the inside\Nout like an engineer of the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The candy boys and candy\Ngirls you see here have
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,used my help to really kick\Ngender in its sorry pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Some men became women and some women men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But all of those hang-ups\Nare a thing of the past
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In short,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,those are the kind of miracles we deal in\Nhere I just provide the hormones Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else provides the dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He changed that man from earlier\Ninto a woman by injecting hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe that there's a\Nplace like this in the middle of a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a dream, it's a dream, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All of these candies\Nyou see around here were
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:22:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,once lost prisoners who\Nmade it here by sheer luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,each with their own story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,See, there are hidden entrances to\NNukamaland on every floor of Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to keep an eye out for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one at the Bloody Mountain of\NNeedles, one in the Lair of Wild Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,one in the Burning Hellfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even one in the Mortuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.44,0:22:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We use these handy-dandy\Npassages to go wherever
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.82,0:22:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we want in this prison to\Nget everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A paradise hiding in the bowels\Nof hell itself why the jailers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,would never believe such an\Nabsurdity exists despite living in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,our hiding hole we still keep\Ntabs on everything that's going
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,on outside we've got a line in\None of the transponder snails the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,very same ones the jailers use\Nthat way we're in on all the hip
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and horrible happenings here in\Nthe prison we also nab newspapers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.46,0:22:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,from the garbage so we can keep\Nup with the other parts of the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,world and we were Totally tuning\Nin to Straw Hat Boy's Wild Ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day we\Nget to see a break in,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,a break out, and all sorts\Nof delectable nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.94,0:23:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We were cheering them on the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems like this place\Nwith yours is gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this place wasn't\Nalways here, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Some prisoner had a Devil Fruit\Npower that was good for digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the first to start\Nchipping away at these caverns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They led other prisoners\Nhere a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.58,0:23:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and bit by bit, the new recruits\Nstarted building this place together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To paint a picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,this paradise of ours is\Nactually a bit like an
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ant farm made from digging\Ntunnels in the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But to answer your question specifically,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we are located right in\Nbetween level 5 and level 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hang on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say level 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not widely known,\Nbut I assure you it is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.78,0:23:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 6 is where the true\Nvillains are kept locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of them is condemned to\Na lifetime sentence without parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.56,0:23:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known as eternal hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Exceedingly wicked crimes are often\Ncovered up by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:24:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As are incidents that would tarnish\Nthe reputation of the powers that be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.26,0:24:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, like your little rampage that\Ntook you all the way to level four.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had tried to pull that\Nsame maneuver a little while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.60,0:24:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't have been so easy, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.96,0:24:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There was another beastly Betty guarding\Nthis prison not too long ago, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the jail manager of\NImpel Down, Shiryu of the Reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And to size him up, he was just as\Nstrong as Warden Magellan. Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,considering that Magellan spends most\Nof his time sitting on the crapper,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.34,0:24:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you might say Shiryu was\Ntwice as troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As strong as the Warden?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.74,0:24:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Security's not too shabby these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.78,0:24:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but when he was around, it\Nwas downright iron tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said he's gone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.10,0:24:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:24:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners aren't\Nhere for your amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.58,0:25:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I remind you that we're\Njailers, not butchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No one cares about the\Nlives of these vermin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.74,0:25:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate this any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone were to find out about\Nhalf the atrocities you've committed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.80,0:25:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Impel Down would be\Ndisgraced beyond measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must exercise my authority as\Nwarden and place you under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.66,0:25:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed prisoners when and as he\Nsaw fit, even on the slightest whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.18,0:25:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He was completely out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.14,0:25:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so now they hold him in the darkest corners\Nof level six as a high-security risk
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.91,0:25:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.00,0:25:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it happened before\NI got here, but even so!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in fine company, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Catalina Davon, the world's most\Ndangerous woman, is down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And San Juan Wolf, the great battleship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.50,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even heavy drinker Vosco Schott.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The names of these criminals are enough\Nto make anyone tremble with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the worst of the worst on\Nlevel six. Half the crimes these
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,villains committed were so heinous\Neven the newspapers dared not mention
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,them your former boss is there too\Ni suppose he was pretty wild in his
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,own way mr zero crocodile back in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.38,0:26:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta you had quite the little
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.02,0:26:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,scuffle with Straw Hat boy didn't\Nyou and look at you now it just goes
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.80,0:26:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to show you that the power of\Nfriendship crosses all boundaries and
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.52,0:26:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one of the warlords down\Nthere the first son of the sea gene
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.06,0:26:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,bay along with that other guy the\None Straw Hat boy came here to save
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,second division commander\Nof the white beard
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates the fire fist\NPortgas d ace i heard
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,about it over the radio\Nthey're brothers if i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.78,0:27:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,not mistaken yes that's\Nright straw boy said he
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,only came to impel down to rescue him it's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,insane that he thought to\Nsneak in and miraculous
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.74,0:27:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that he did it um too\Nbad his plan is dead in
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the water now he has to\Nsave himself first which?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,unfortunately means that\Nhe's out of time ace
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.24,0:27:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,boy is set to be executed\Nthis afternoon at
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,3 p .m I believe they're going to transfer
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,him to Navy Headquarters\Nsometime this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already past midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so that means Ace Boy will be taken out\Nof Impel Down in seven or eight hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.24,0:27:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.56,0:27:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sprawl Boy's treatment is going to\Ntake two more days to run its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if he survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.50,0:27:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll need another three days of\Nrecovery to restore his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.90,0:27:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So by the time he wakes\Nup, it'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.24,0:27:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.66,0:27:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't take two more\Ndays of that torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's killing him. As I\Ntold you, his chances are
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.86,0:27:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,extremely low will need\Na miracle to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one that\Nneeds rest you had a rough
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.54,0:28:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,run to eat something\Nnutritious and go back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you feel like your old self again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.50,0:28:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a nice quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.04,0:28:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just perfect for nappy time Screw that\NI'm staying with straw boy easy easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.90,0:28:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need little\Nhope he'll survive anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.62,0:28:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's doing back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much he can do, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.14,0:28:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.78,0:28:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.18,0:28:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been doing that this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.69,0:29:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.61,0:29:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yell him back alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're telling me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even find\None little twinkle-toe!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.22,0:29:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for him again, you simpletons!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.56,0:29:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So please hang in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.48,0:29:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,there Hang in there
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.26,0:29:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live Straw boy
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there Hang in
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.16,0:29:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.24,0:30:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.52,0:30:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.28,0:30:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.80,0:30:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.06,0:30:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.32,0:30:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just heard some strange news from\Nthe canteen staff on level 5. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.72,0:30:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Straw Hat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.72,0:30:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.66,0:30:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.84,0:30:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden Hannibal, What in\Nthe world are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.96,0:31:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen Ace, that woman, I admit\NI don't know anything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think it's safe to\Nassume she's pulling your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just saying she came all the\Nway down here just to lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.60,0:31:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.00,0:31:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you mean well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.68,0:31:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But honestly, my brother\Nreally would break into here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.46,0:31:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He does stupid things without thinking\Nall the time since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.38,0:31:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always been reckless\Nand made me worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.20,0:31:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.94,0:32:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes they've stopped despite how excruciating\Nthe treatment is I fear his silence
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.62,0:32:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Brings grim hiddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.20,0:32:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a true
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pity and
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.48,0:32:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,yeti fought valiantly for over 20 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.42,0:32:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw boy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.46,0:32:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.20,0:32:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.18,0:32:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It made more sense when he was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.34,0:32:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The hormone treatment\Nhasn't even gone a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.42,0:33:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.62,0:33:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden Magellan, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.53,0:33:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.14,0:33:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.05,0:33:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Diarrhea. Please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's time for\Nthe transfer of Portgas D.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.88,0:33:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.83,0:33:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's\Ncooked or not, just pile it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.56,0:33:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it close to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.81,0:33:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking in food like his\Nstomach's made of quicksand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.32,0:33:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this guy was tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.76,0:33:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's he put it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been 30 minutes, and\Nhe shows no signs of stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.70,0:33:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.34,0:33:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes a whole week of food for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.24,0:33:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's got some vitality.\NI'll give him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:34:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's not natural, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.80,0:34:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.92,0:34:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All better!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.54,0:34:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
